@startuml
!theme plain
title OpenData 4.0.0 first-run SQL Server initialisation
actor Operator
participant "OpenData / bootstrap loader" as Main
participant "InitialisationWizard (JavaFX)" as Wizard
participant "InitialisationService" as Service
participant "PluginRegistrationResolver" as PluginDiscovery
participant "SqlServerInitialiser" as SQL
database "SQL Server" as Database
participant "ApplicationBootstrapPropertiesLoader" as Props
Operator -> Main: Start application
Main -> Props: Read init flag
Props --> Main: init=true
Main -> Wizard: Open first-run wizard
Operator -> Wizard: SQL server/admin + app account + AES key location
Wizard -> Wizard: Validate required values and confirmation
Operator -> Wizard: Review / Initialise
Wizard -> Service: initialise(InitialisationRequest) [background Task]
Service -> PluginDiscovery: Discover and validate definitions
PluginDiscovery --> Service: Validated plugin list
Service -> Service: Validate/create AES key (do not overwrite)
Service -> SQL: Create database and application SQL login
SQL -> Database: Core schema, configuration, registry and audit DDL
Database --> SQL: Result
loop Each discovered plugin
  SQL -> Database: Install plugin schema using admin login
  Database --> SQL: Result
end
SQL --> Service: Initialisation result
Service -> Database: Store configuration and disabled registrations
Database --> Service: Confirm
Service -> Props: Atomically write encrypted bootstrap / init=false
Props --> Service: Complete
Service --> Wizard: Success
Wizard --> Operator: Finish — Open OpenData
note over Wizard,Operator
  On failure, display the error and log.
  Keep init=true and do not launch main GUI.
end note
@enduml
